A: You can already say я живу́ в большо́й кварти́ре.
    draw plan known1

A: Today we go inside: the rooms, the furniture, and where things are. (@draw tom tom_name masha masha_name@) Listen first: I ask Masha where the cat is.

    erase known1

A: Ма́ша, где кот?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

B: Кот на дива́не.
    draw balloon_m caption false

    ask "Where's the cat?" listen "Кот на дива́не." voice b gloss "The cat's on the sofa." options ["on the table","on the window","on the sofa"] correct 3 reveal.text "Кот на дива́не." reveal.at.x 790 reveal.at.y 620 reveal.style label reveal.size 46 reveal.color #3d3833 pool false
        right: On the sofa: на дива́не. Дива́н is a sofa.
        wrong: Not на столе́ or на окне́: the new word sounds like an English one, divan.

    erase balloon_m tom tom_name masha masha_name question_1_stamp

A: So, the flat. The main room is just ко́мната, a room.
    draw l_komn g_komn

B: Ку́хня, спа́льня, ва́нная.
    draw l_kuh g_kuh l_spal g_spal l_van g_van

B: Я в спа́льне.
    draw p_spal

A: That's the е of в ко́мнате, from lesson fifty-eight: спа́льня, в спа́льне.
    highlight p_spal color #d0865f part е$ effect underline

B: Я на ку́хне.
    draw p_kuh

A: But the kitchen takes на: Russians say на ку́хне. Learn it with its на.
    highlight p_kuh color #5b8c5a part ^на effect underline

B: Я в ва́нной.
    draw p_van

A: Ва́нная, from ва́нна, a bath, is an adjective at heart: ва́нная ко́мната, the bath room. So it says (@draw p_bolsh@) ой, like в большо́й кварти́ре.
    highlight p_van color #d0865f part ой$ effect underline

    erase p_bolsh p_spal p_kuh p_van g_komn g_kuh g_spal g_van

A: Now the furniture. In the room stands a дива́н, and (@draw p_sofa@) on it is на дива́не.
    draw f_sofa l_sofa f_cook f_bath

A: In the bedroom, a bed: крова́ть.
    draw f_bed l_bed

B: On the bed is на крова́ти: a she-word in ь takes и.
    draw p_bed

    highlight p_bed color #d0865f part и$ effect underline

A: And a шкаф: a wardrobe, or a cupboard.
    draw f_shkaf l_shkaf

A: In it is в шкафу́, with a stressed (@highlight p_shkaf color #d0865f part у$ effect underline@) у, not е: learn it as a phrase.
    draw p_shkaf

    erase flat_all places

A: For things in a room, Russian (@draw v_sofa@) doesn't just say is: (@draw v_book@) it says whether they (@draw v_shirt@) stand, lie or hang.

B: Дива́н стои́т в ко́мнате.
    draw v1

A: Стои́т, it stands: anything upright on its feet, a sofa, a bed, a шкаф.
    highlight v1 color #2f6b8f part стои́т effect underline

B: Кни́га лежи́т на столе́.
    draw v2

A: Лежи́т, it lies: anything flat, a book on the table, or a cat on the bed.
    highlight v2 color #2f6b8f part лежи́т effect underline

B: Руба́шка виси́т в шкафу́.
    draw v3

A: And виси́т, it hangs: a shirt in the wardrobe. Stands, lies or hangs: Russian mostly picks one.
    highlight v3 color #2f6b8f part виси́т effect underline

    erase verbs

A: Now I can't find my shirt. Listen, then practise it.
    draw tom2 tom2_name masha2 masha2_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Кото́рая, from lesson sixty-nine: a shirt that's lying on the sofa.
    highlight talk_6_words color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase talk

    hide tom2 tom2_name masha2 masha2_name

    draw q_cook

    quiz "Which room goes with на, not в?" reveal.text "на ку́хне" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Ку́хня: Russians say на ку́хне.
        wrong: One room breaks the в rule. Where do you cook?
        * спа́льня
        + ку́хня
        * ва́нная

    erase q_cook

    draw q_book

    quiz "The book is lying on the table: Кни́га ___ на столе́." reveal.text "Кни́га лежи́т на столе́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Лежи́т: a book lies flat.
        wrong: A book on a table is flat, not upright or hanging.
        * стои́т
        * виси́т
        + лежи́т

    erase q_book

    draw q_shirt

    ask "Where is the shirt?" voice b options ["in the wardrobe","on the bed","in the kitchen"] correct 1 reveal.text "Руба́шка виси́т в шкафу́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        gloss: The shirt is hanging in the wardrobe.
        listen: Руба́шка виси́т в шкафу́.
        right: In the wardrobe: виси́т в шкафу́, hanging.
        wrong: Listen for the last word: в шкафу́.

    erase q_shirt

    draw q_cat q_bed2

    ask say_it "Кот лежи́т на крова́ти." gloss "The cat is lying on the bed." voice a show cue reveal.text "Кот лежи́т на крова́ти." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1

    erase q_cat q_bed2

    draw q_sofa

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: The sofa is standing in the room." answer ["диван стоит в комнате","в комнате стоит диван","диван в комнате стоит"] reveal.text "Дива́н стои́т в ко́мнате." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Дива́н стои́т в ко́мнате: upright, so стои́т, and ко́мната takes е.
        wrong: Start with Дива́н стои́т, then в and the room with its е.

    erase q_sofa

    group board members ["b1","b2","b3"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So: rooms take в and the е, but на ку́хне; ва́нная says ой, a bed на крова́ти, and в шкафу́. And a thing стои́т, лежи́т or виси́т.
    highlight b1 b2 b3 color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase board

B: Я на ку́хне. Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 380 y 480 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_cook size 150 set twemoji x 620 y 480 or ["cooking"] icon_look picture of "pot of food"
    text end_say "Я на ку́хне. Пока́!" say "Я на ку́хне. Пока́!" say_voice b colors {"е$":"#d0865f"} x 500 y 300 font_size 64

    erase end_masha end_cook end_say

A: Next time: cooking, на ку́хне.
    box next73 "Next: lesson 73 · Cooking" x 500 y 430 width 640 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

